cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these formulas, certificates or scripts, please cite the
  paper below, and optionally this software/data archive.
type: software
title: >-
  Data and certificates for "Zero-sum Ramsey numbers of disjoint cliques
  modulo 3 and a counterexample to a conjecture of Caro and Provstgaard"
abstract: >-
  CNF formulas, DRAT certificates, logs and verification scripts
  establishing R(2K_3,Z_3) = 8, R(2K_4,Z_3) = 10 and R(3K_4,Z_3) = 13.
  The last refutes Conjecture 1 of Caro and Provstgaard (J. Graph Theory
  32 (1999) 207-216).
